00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:16.320
especially on catalyst-driven days like today. Imagine you saw the major AI acquisition headline

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:21.460
hit the wires this morning and immediately placed a market order to buy 500 shares of a mid-cap

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:27.920
